From 82d00886c8cf9ed5d3cc25fe608243ef82b31ba6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lance <Gero3977@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:57:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ImsMedia: defer native audio open until SDP exists

Treat a config-less Java open as a real session without a native media graph. Build that graph from the first modify config, report its result as the modify response, queue native operations across the opening window, and make close/failure races null-safe without emitting a second open callback.

Cover success, synchronous failure, queued operations, close-before-config, and close-during-open.

Assisted-by: Hermes-Agent:stepfun/step-5-preview:free
Signed-off-by: Lance <Gero3977@gmail.com>
